{"seq":1,"slug":"event-store-technologies","title":"事件存储技术选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/event-sourcing-cqrs/infrastructure/event-store-technologies","wordCount":1072,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件存储技术选型\">事件存储技术选型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件存储是事件溯源系统的基础设施核心，其选型直接影响系统的性能上限、运维复杂度和功能边界。市面上的方案分为三大阵营：专用事件存储数据库（如 EventStoreDB）、通用消息平台（如 Apache Kafka）、以及基于关系型数据库的自建方案（如 PostgreSQL）。每种方案的设计哲学和适用场景截然不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 专用事件存储&#10;        A[EventStoreDB] --&gt; A1[原生事件流]&#10;        A --&gt; A2[内置投影引擎]&#10;        A --&gt; A3[竞争消费者]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 消息平台&#10;        B[Apache Kafka] --&gt; B1[分区日志]&#10;        B --&gt; B2[消费者组]&#10;        B --&gt; B3[高吞吐]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 关系型自建&#10;        C[PostgreSQL] --&gt; C1[事件表+约束]&#10;        C --&gt; C2[NOTIFY/LISTEN]&#10;        C --&gt; C3[灵活查询]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 专用事件存储\n        A[EventStoreDB] --&gt; A1[原生事件流]\n        A --&gt; A2[内置投影引擎]\n        A --&gt; A3[竞争消费者]\n    end\n    subgraph 消息平台\n        B[Apache Kafka] --&gt; B1[分区日志]\n        B --&gt; B2[消费者组]\n        B --&gt; B3[高吞吐]\n    end\n    subgraph 关系型自建\n        C[PostgreSQL] --&gt; C1[事件表+约束]\n        C --&gt; C2[NOTIFY/LISTEN]\n        C --&gt; C3[灵活查询]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>EventStoreDB</th>\n<th>Apache Kafka</th>\n<th>PostgreSQL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定位</td>\n<td>专用事件存储</td>\n<td>分布式日志平台</td>\n<td>通用关系型数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件流语义</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>需Topic映射</td>\n<td>需自行设计表结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乐观并发</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>需唯一约束实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局排序</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>分区内有序</td>\n<td>需自增序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅能力</td>\n<td>持久订阅 + 竞争消费</td>\n<td>消费者组</td>\n<td>NOTIFY或轮询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影支持</td>\n<td>内置 JS 投影</td>\n<td>需外部实现</td>\n<td>需外部实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（ZooKeeper/KRaft）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区生态</td>\n<td>小众</td>\n<td>极大</td>\n<td>极大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合规模</td>\n<td>中小型</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>起步阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的核心考量因素是团队能力、系统规模和功能需求。没有&quot;最好&quot;的事件存储，只有&quot;最适合&quot;的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eventstoredb-深度分析\">EventStoreDB 深度分析</h2><p>EventStoreDB 是唯一从底层专门为事件溯源设计的数据库。它的核心概念就是事件流——不需要任何映射层或适配器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EventStoreDBClient {&#10;  appendToStream(&#10;    streamName: string,&#10;    events: ReadonlyArray&lt;EventData&gt;,&#10;    options?: AppendToStreamOptions,&#10;  ): Promise&lt;AppendResult&gt;;&#10;&#10;  readStream(streamName: string, options?: ReadStreamOptions): ReadableStream&lt;ResolvedEvent&gt;;&#10;&#10;  subscribeToAll(options?: SubscribeToAllOptions): ReadableStream&lt;ResolvedEvent&gt;;&#10;&#10;  subscribeToStream(streamName: string, options?: SubscribeToStreamOptions): ReadableStream&lt;ResolvedEvent&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const connectToEventStoreDB = (connectionString: string): EventStoreDBClient =&gt; {&#10;  const client = EventStoreDBClient.connectionString(connectionString);&#10;  return client;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const appendOrderEvent = async (&#10;  client: EventStoreDBClient,&#10;  orderId: string,&#10;  event: OrderEvent,&#10;  expectedRevision: bigint,&#10;): Promise&lt;void&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const eventData = jsonEvent({&#10;    type: event.eventType,&#10;    data: event.payload,&#10;    metadata: event.metadata,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  await client.appendToStream(`order-${orderId}`, [eventData], {&#10;    expectedRevision,&#10;  });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventStoreDBClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  appendToStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    streamName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    events</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">EventData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppendToStreamOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AppendResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  readStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">streamName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadStreamOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadableStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ResolvedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  subscribeToAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubscribeToAllOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadableStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ResolvedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  subscribeToStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">streamName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubscribeToStreamOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadableStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ResolvedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> connectToEventStoreDB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">connectionString</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventStoreDBClient</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EventStoreDBClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connectionString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(connectionString);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> appendOrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventStoreDBClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expectedRevision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> eventData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jsonEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: event.eventType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data: event.payload,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metadata: event.metadata,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendToStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`order-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [eventData], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expectedRevision,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>EventStoreDB 的独特优势包括：按流类别订阅（<code>$ce-order</code> 可以订阅所有 order 开头的流）、内置的投影引擎（用 JavaScript 编写服务端投影）、以及竞争消费者（多个消费者实例自动负载均衡）。其劣势在于社区规模较小、运维经验不如传统数据库丰富。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kafka-作为事件存储\">Kafka 作为事件存储</h2><p>Apache Kafka 的分区日志模型天然适合事件的追加写入和有序消费。但将 Kafka 用作事件存储需要解决几个关键差异：Kafka 不支持流级别的乐观并发控制，且分区而非流是基本的排序单元。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface KafkaEventStore {&#10;  appendToStream(streamId: string, events: ReadonlyArray&lt;NewEvent&gt;): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;&#10;  readStream(streamId: string): Promise&lt;ReadonlyArray&lt;PersistedEvent&gt;&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createKafkaEventStore = (&#10;  producer: KafkaProducer,&#10;  consumer: KafkaConsumer,&#10;  topicPrefix: string,&#10;): KafkaEventStore =&gt; ({&#10;  async appendToStream(streamId, events) {&#10;    const topic = `${topicPrefix}.events`;&#10;    const messages = events.map((event) =&gt; ({&#10;      key: streamId,&#10;      value: JSON.stringify({&#10;        streamId,&#10;        eventType: event.eventType,&#10;        data: event.data,&#10;        metadata: event.metadata,&#10;        timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;      }),&#10;      headers: {&#10;        &#39;event-type&#39;: event.eventType,&#10;        &#39;stream-id&#39;: streamId,&#10;      },&#10;    }));&#10;&#10;    await producer.send({ topic, messages });&#10;  },&#10;&#10;  async readStream(streamId) {&#10;    const events: PersistedEvent[] = [];&#10;    await consumer.subscribe({ topic: `${topicPrefix}.events` });&#10;&#10;    return events.filter((e) =&gt; e.streamId === streamId);&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KafkaEventStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  appendToStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">streamId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  readStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">streamId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PersistedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark: